## Dependency manager

The project uses `pyproject.toml` with these declared deps. To add one:

```bash
# Edit pyproject.toml [project.dependencies], then:
pip install -e .
# Or if the project uses uv:
uv sync
```

Do not introduce a parallel `requirements.txt` — one source of truth.

